利奥臀部，随着手势，奥利奥的屁股被拍的一阵晃悠，奥利奥尾巴僵直炸起，苏苗苗垂眼含笑，手腕抬起又放下：苏苗苗：\"别怕，等把蛋噶掉，以后脾气就乖啦～\"\n\n特写 - 斜俯 - 缓慢推轨 - 俯角机位\n麻醉针筒银亮针尖逼近奥利奥屁股蛋，奥利奥全身短毛根根竖立，瞳孔缩成细线，喉咙低鸣，针尖反射冷光 `high-focus depth of field`\n\n特写 - 平视 - 固定 - 正面机位\n奥利奥张嘴尖嚎，胡须前弹，声带绷紧，鎏金瞳骤亮：奥利奥：\"喵！！\"\n\n全景 - 仰拍 - 缓慢拉轨 - 低角度机位\n一道耀眼圣光从诊疗台炸开，白光吞没奥利奥轮廓，苏苗苗抬臂挡眼，衣摆被气流掀动，诊疗器械被光浪映亮\n\n中全景 - 仰拍 - 固定 - 低角度机位\n圣光散去，君无烬立于原地，银白长发垂落，玄色长袍衣襟半敞，一手捂住下身，眉头拧紧瞪向苏苗苗，银发随气流轻晃\n\n中近景 - 斜仰 - 手持 - 侧面机位\n君无烬下颌咬肌收紧，瞳孔锁定苏苗苗，鼻翼微翕，胸腔蓄势：君无烬：\"大胆凡女！竟敢戏弄本帝的龙珠！\" `cinematic handheld camera`\n", 8512, 768, 124, "match"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 1, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "vae", "link": 28, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "audio_vae", "link": 3, "label": "audio_vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "audio_vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_0", "link": 4, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_0", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_0"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_1", "link": 5, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_2", "link": 6, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_3", "link": 7, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_4", "link": 8, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_5", "link": 9, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_6", "link": 10, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_7", "link": 11, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_7"}, {"shape